@startuml 内存桶模式释放流程

' 使用中文标题
title DTVM内存桶模式释放流程

' 设置样式
skinparam {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  ArrowColor #2C3E50
  SequenceArrowThickness 2
  SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #3498DB
  SequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
  ParticipantBorderColor #3498DB
  NoteBackgroundColor #E8F8F5
  NoteBorderColor #16A085
}

' 定义参与者
participant "Runtime" as RT
participant "Instance" as Inst
participant "WasmMemoryAllocator" as Allocator
participant "操作系统" as OS

' 定义序列
RT -> Inst : 1. 销毁实例
activate Inst

Inst -> Allocator : 2. 调用freeWasmMemory
activate Allocator

Allocator -> Allocator : 3. 调用internalFreeWasmMemory
note right: 根据内存类型执行不同的释放操作

alt 内存类型为WM_MEMORY_DATA_TYPE_BUCKET_MMAP
  Allocator -> Allocator : 4a. 查找内存地址对应的桶地址
  
  Allocator -> Allocator : 5a. 增加桶释放计数
  note right: 记录已释放的桶项数量
  
  alt 所有桶项都已释放
    Allocator -> OS : 6a.1. 调用munmap释放整个内存桶
    OS --> Allocator : 返回结果
    
    Allocator -> Allocator : 7a.1. 清理相关数据结构
    note right: 从ActiveBuckets、MemoryAddrToMmapAddr\n和MmapBucketsFreedCount中移除
  else 还有桶项在使用
    Allocator -> Allocator : 6a.2. 只从映射中移除
    note right: 从MemoryAddrToMmapAddr中移除，\n但保留内存桶
  end
else 内存类型为WM_MEMORY_DATA_TYPE_SINGLE_MMAP
  Allocator -> OS : 4b. 调用munmap释放内存
  OS --> Allocator : 返回结果
else 内存类型为WM_MEMORY_DATA_TYPE_MALLOC
  Allocator -> Allocator : 4c. 调用deallocate释放内存
end

Allocator --> Inst : 返回结果
deactivate Allocator

Inst --> RT : 返回结果
deactivate Inst

@enduml
